<title>BRAZIL: Brazil CS sugar output to Nov 1 - AIAA.</title>
<headline>Brazil CS sugar output to Nov 1 - AIAA.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results to Nov 1 of the 1996/97 sugar harvest in Brazil's centre-south region were as follows, said the Association of Sugar and Alcohol Industries of Sao Paulo (AIAA).</p>
<p>				   1996/97	     1995/96</p>
<p>			   01/11    16/10     01/11    16/10</p>
<p>SUGAR CANE (million tonnes)   205.87   191.35    180.56   168.95</p>
<p>SUGAR (million tonnes)	    9.39     8.72	8.18     7.69</p>
<p>ALCOHOL (million cubic meters) 10.77    10.06	9.64     9.02</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
